{
  "id": "p34",
  "title": "The Pump House Gala",
  "titleZh": "泵房之夜",
  "topic": "泵房慈善晚会",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My council borrows a huge pump house for the charity night.",
        "zh": "我的议会为慈善之夜借下一座巨大的泵房。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its concrete walls reflect the blue light of the old engines.",
        "zh": "它的混凝土墙映着老发动机的蓝光。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Steam once ran the pumps, and electricity now lights the hall.",
        "zh": "蒸汽曾推动水泵，如今电灯照亮大厅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A long chain of pipes runs onto the upper floor.",
        "zh": "一长串管道一直延伸到楼上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We expand the wooden stage and tap a new water source for the pumps.",
        "zh": "我们扩建木制舞台，并为水泵接通一处新水源。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a banker visits and makes a generous offer.",
        "zh": "接着一位银行家来访，提出一笔慷慨的捐助。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The gala opens with a short opera and a long luxury dinner.",
        "zh": "晚会以一出短歌剧和一顿漫长的奢华晚餐开场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A businessman brings goods, and the delivery is on time.",
        "zh": "一位商人送来货物，送货很准时。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its shaped roof and great length impress every guest.",
        "zh": "它造型独特的屋顶和巨大的长度让每位客人都赞叹。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The banker states a figure in sterling and signs the pledge.",
        "zh": "银行家报出一个英镑数字，并签下认捐书。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He wants an accurate sum before the papers arrive.",
        "zh": "他想在文件送到前得到一个准确的总额。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A deputy checks every item and traces the origin of each gift.",
        "zh": "一位副手核对每件物品，追溯每份礼物的来源。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The board asks for a guarantee and a clear objective.",
        "zh": "董事会要求一份保证，以及一个明确的目标。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The spokesman promises a lasting link to the town and its people.",
        "zh": "发言人承诺与小镇及镇上的人们建立持久的联系。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We organize a squad to inspect the old stone chamber.",
        "zh": "我们组织了一个小队，检查那间旧石砌机房。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A sudden storm threatens to smash the stage lights.",
        "zh": "一场骤起的暴风雨扬言要砸坏舞台灯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My guest feels anxiety and takes a small white pill.",
        "zh": "我的一位客人感到焦虑，吃了一片小白药丸。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The infection is mild, and her mental state improves.",
        "zh": "感染很轻，她的精神状态好转了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a routine check finds a leak near the main tap.",
        "zh": "接着例行检查发现主水龙头附近有处渗漏。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Obviously the relief is great, and nobody leaves.",
        "zh": "显然大家松了口气，没有人离场。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later a legal controversy about the money reaches the local press.",
        "zh": "后来一桩关于这笔钱的法律争议传到本地报馆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A militant group threatens a protest outside the gate.",
        "zh": "一个激进团体扬言要在门外抗议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The host's conduct looks equal parts careful and strange.",
        "zh": "主人的举止看来既谨慎又古怪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His thinking is clear, but the figures do not yield.",
        "zh": "他的思路清楚，可数字对不上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We obtain a new chapter of the audit and eliminate the error.",
        "zh": "我们拿到了审计的新一章，并排除了那处错误。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The clerk must resign, and the marine insurer calls back.",
        "zh": "那位职员必须辞职，海事保险公司也回了电话。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My role is small, but the relief is real and permanent.",
        "zh": "我的角色很小，但那份宽慰真实而持久。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our strategy is simple, and the consequence is a fair and open review.",
        "zh": "我们的策略很简单，结果是一场公正公开的复核。"
      }
    ]
  ],
